  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "八八風災hit幾日"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>黃明勝</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">八八風災hit幾日，2009年8月初8 ê『莫拉克』風颱，是南台灣傷心ê日子。無情ê風雨、恐怖ê大水，強風暴雨造成空前ê災難。雨tuì 8月初7開始落，tī高雄縣甲仙ê小林村、納瑪夏鄉、桃源鄉、六龜鄉kap茂林鄉，koh有屏東縣ê佳冬鄉、林邊鄉，造成tsiok大ê傷亡。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿媽逐工看新聞、流目屎，看直升機一隻koh一隻一直飛一直飛，等待ê家屬掠天頂金金看，求天公伯--à來保庇。阿公ê心mā真沉重，8月12雨停了後，看阿公一直khà電話，聯絡慈濟人到災區，關懷災地ê鄉親序大kap親tsiânn朋友。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">想起tsit斗八八風災ê災民，有ê人iau幾若工，有ê人kan-na食泡麵，koh-khah心酸--ê，是有ê災民ê親人已經無tī身軀邊。我leh想，我ē-sái為災民做啥mih代誌？Tsit个時tsūn，想起學校ê志工師姊，kā問：「Kám ē-sái hōo我加入慈濟救災團隊？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我來到災區，看著hiah-nī仔濟ê人，心內起giâu疑，人是tuì佗位來--ê？一車koh一車，一箱koh一箱ê物資送入災區，tuì四周圍直直來。八八風災hit幾日，有錢--ê出錢，有力--ê出力，有ê阿兵哥一工睏無幾點鐘，有ê人主動來做義工，tàu piànn掃，大粒汗、細粒汗。跤踏塗，tsiah知影水有偌深；手kuānn塗，tsiah知影責任有偌重；入去災區，tsiah知影受災者ê心是偌nī仔疼。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雖然大水無情，m̄-koh人間有愛，lán ê愛lóng仝款。你ē想著我，我ē想著你，我相信，互相疼惜ê日子，生活上kài suí。後擺講hōo囝兒序細聽，早前八八風災hit幾日，我有去過旗山、林邊、佳冬，出淡薄仔力、流淡薄仔汗，he是我一生中，上kài有意義ê hit幾工。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE9eDeCwJgKzuHzmJ_xbM71HAdCSBQjS0dFWgfyfwucTzxSIAQhlqz5UCVeM4TGAMpJd0v2d5ztLvA-s4Jkbz0oMQIBbmMTLkKZbzs--zOyDWgxjyQ0VFXtaAVOtzWvS4d7ZBzk25KGaKXBAKrZh2QC1ExxRk2BfFX_A1gLO52fymmPv3beNwdJNvysw/s1424/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE9eDeCwJgKzuHzmJ_xbM71HAdCSBQjS0dFWgfyfwucTzxSIAQhlqz5UCVeM4TGAMpJd0v2d5ztLvA-s4Jkbz0oMQIBbmMTLkKZbzs--zOyDWgxjyQ0VFXtaAVOtzWvS4d7ZBzk25KGaKXBAKrZh2QC1ExxRk2BfFX_A1gLO52fymmPv3beNwdJNvysw/w450-h640/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj_I_EbnHk5J_qJE8hpRbcVMRxIbQCiQXOJLdGISHa1-8wCoMwUKrcLXbDiN404uF8fGbtYvx45cIg06ZXMAwIdGlsfn2vRzm4fubee6vKVkK9-hD33c9aXIX17nG63mWQS77BKlGRY4c5Lrye0f5s_0Fe_kHLEVy7fUQtuiuVfILo4b6vd3YK189ULyw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1341%E6%9C%9F_32.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj_I_EbnHk5J_qJE8hpRbcVMRxIbQCiQXOJLdGISHa1-8wCoMwUKrcLXbDiN404uF8fGbtYvx45cIg06ZXMAwIdGlsfn2vRzm4fubee6vKVkK9-hD33c9aXIX17nG63mWQS77BKlGRY4c5Lrye0f5s_0Fe_kHLEVy7fUQtuiuVfILo4b6vd3YK189ULyw/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1341%E6%9C%9F_32.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"